# Shell scripts must stay LF even when checked out on Windows. app/Dockerfile
# COPYs docker-entrypoint.d/*.sh straight from the working tree, and CRLF there
# makes the container fail with "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M". CI checks out on
# Linux so it would only ever break for someone building locally on Windows —
# the worst kind of bug to leave lying around.
*.sh text eol=lf
